-- composition in the universe: a type of its own (Cubical Agda's hcomp in Type) whose faces are
-- the tube's type lines from the base, with the complement of the tube's face on the base itself,
-- so a closed composition of types is a type, never a formal one. Its elements are glue values;
-- on a face unglue is transport back along that face's line
%comp-u u A0 = %hcompU A0 (sys+ (%fneg (faceof u)) (λ (j : I) → A0) u)
